/T (ABSTRACT  This report presents an account of the Summer Internship undertaken by Paarth Gupta, a Computer Science and Engineering student of KIET Group of Institutions, Ghaziabad, during the session 2026-27. The internship was pursued through two globally recognized platforms: the Cisco Networking Academy, offering the JavaScript Essentials 1 course under the JS Institute curriculum, and Oracle University, offering the Agentic AI Certified Foundations program. )
/E (ABSTRACT  This report presents an account of the Summer Internship undertaken by Paarth Gupta, a Computer Science and Engineering student of KIET Group of Institutions, Ghaziabad, during the session 2026-27. The internship was pursued through two globally recognized platforms: the Cisco Networking Academy, offering the JavaScript Essentials 1 course under the JS Institute curriculum, and Oracle University, offering the Agentic AI Certified Foundations program. )
