/T (Successfully completed two industry-recognized professional certifications: JavaScript Essentials 1 \(Cisco Networking Academy\) and Agentic AI Certified Foundations Associate \(Oracle University\).  Strengthened core programming skills in JavaScript.  Expanded knowledge of modern Full Stack technologies, including React.js and Node.js.  Gained a foundational understanding of Agentic AI, AI agents, and intelligent automation concepts.  Improved problem-solving, analytical thinking, and continuous learning skills. )
