/P 84 0 R
/E (The Summer Internship provided valuable, industry-aligned exposure to both modern web development and emerging Artificial Intelligence technologies. Through the Cisco Networking Academy's JavaScript Essentials 1 course and Oracle University's Agentic AI Certified Foundations program, the intern was able to strengthen core programming skills, gain practical knowledge of the MERN Stack, and develop a working understanding of Agentic AI, LLMs, and AI agent frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, and RAG. The successful completion of two industry-recognized certifications validates the skills and knowledge acquired during this period and marks a significant step toward becoming industry-ready in the domains of Full Stack Development and Artificial Intelligence. )
