/Title (ABSTRACT  This report presents an account of the Summer Internship undertaken by Paarth Gupta, a Computer Science and Engineering student of KIET Group of Institutions, Ghaziabad, during the session 2026-27. The internship was pursued through two globally recognized platforms: the Cisco Networking Academy, offering the JavaScript Essentials 1 course under the JS Institute curriculum, and Oracle University, offering the Agentic AI Certified Foundations program.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 300 0 R
/Next 415 0 R
>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<<
/Title (Successfully completed two industry-recognized professional certifications: JavaScript Essentials 1 \(Cisco Networking Academy\) and Agentic AI Certified Foundations Associate \(Oracle University\).  Strengthened core programming skills in JavaScript.  Expanded knowledge of modern Full Stack technologies, including React.js and Node.js.  Gained a foundational understanding of Agentic AI, AI agents, and intelligent automation concepts.  Improved problem-solving, analytical thinking, and continuous learning skills.)
