/Title (The internship focused on strengthening core programming logic and modern web application development using JavaScript, and extended into the MERN Stack ecosystem, covering React.js for frontend development and Node.js for backend development. In parallel, the intern gained a practical understanding of Agentic AI concepts, including Large Language Model \(LLM\) fundamentals, prompt engineering, and modern AI agent frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\).)
